  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Volatility spikes originating in global markets due to US‑Iran shocks transmit through common investor positions and cross‑listed assets, raising realized and implied volatility in the markets and instruments most sensitive to the Russia‑Ukraine war.</data>
