  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Sharp energy supply disruptions raise input costs and compress corporate and LP cash flows, prompting firms and VCs to postpone or cut capital allocations to capital‑intensive AI projects and rounds.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_conflict</data>
