  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher geopolitical tensions raise naval deployments, incident risk in key chokepoints and the probability of sanctions or trade restrictions, directly increasing the risk of oil supply disruptions.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
