  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Escalating US–China tech tensions drive deeper China–Russia coordination on sanctions circumvention and dual‑use technology transfers, directly enhancing Russia's sustainment and escalation capacity and thereby raising the geographic spread and intensity of the Russia–Ukraine conflict.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
