  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising cross-border capital flows finance new generation and transmission projects (including merchant and private builds supporting industrial and data‑centre loads), accelerating additions to available power capacity in capital‑receiving markets.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
