  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">A rivalry-induced reduction in cross-border capital flows (notably Chinese financing) to Iranian upstream and export infrastructure reduces maintenance, investment and export capacity, increasing the likelihood of near-term energy supply disruptions.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">us_iran_conflict</data>
