  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher net cross-border capital availability directly increases foreign VC, corporate and portfolio investments into domestic AI firms and funds, boosting net capital allocated to AI.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
