  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">An increase in assessed oil‑supply disruption risk raises risk premia on crude, prompts sellers to hoard or curtail forward sales and buyers to pay greater bid premiums, directly pushing spot and futures prices higher within weeks.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_energy_supply_sho</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
