  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising oil-supply disruption risk lifts energy price risk premia and forces rapid repricing across commodity, FX and equity markets, producing larger and more frequent price swings (higher realized and implied volatility).</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_energy_supply_sho</data>
  <data key="d40">us_iran_conflict</data>
