  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher risk of oil supply disruptions elevates energy and logistics costs and macroeconomic uncertainty, prompting investors to pull back or reprice funding for energy‑intensive AI deployments and projects, reducing net capital flows into AI.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
